{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27612","headline":"感王将军柘枝妓殁 · 张祜","name":"感王将军柘枝妓殁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞春风旧柘枝，舞人休唱曲休吹。\n鸳鸯钿带抛何处，孔雀罗衫付阿谁。\n画鼓不闻招节拍，锦靴空想挫腰肢。\n今来座上偏惆怅，曾是堂前教彻时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}